{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"URGENT ESCALATION — this is no longer quiet-window-only: the tickets-store pack has crossed the\nCI Verified gate limit and is now BLOCKING ALL GERRIT LANDINGS.\n\nEvidence (from Gerrit 1376 / 9305 CI run 30943544226, and confirmed in-tree):\n  .github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml:224  REBAR_TICKETS_PACK_LIMIT_KIB: 131072\n  .github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml:270-280  \"Fail closed if the filtered tickets pack\n     exceeds its limit\" -> emits \"::error::tickets pack is <N> KiB; limit is 131072 KiB\"\n  Observed: filtered tickets pack = 131431 KiB  (359 KiB over the 131072 KiB / 128 MiB limit).\n\nImpact: every change now gets Verified -1 on the pack-size step regardless of code correctness.\nThe in-flight changes 1376 (9305, PS4 pushed, pytest fixed) and 1386 (1dbe) are code-complete but\ncannot earn Verified +1 until the filtered tickets pack is brought back under 128 MiB.\n\nRemediation (this ticket's git-maintenance scope): repack/gc the tickets branch history so the\nFILTERED pack (what CI measures, not the full local objects dir) drops under 131072 KiB — e.g.\ngit maintenance / repack -adf + prune of unreachable ticket-event objects on the tickets branch,\nplus the ~1 GiB spent-reclaim already in scope. Coordinate as a quiet-window op (the tickets\nbranch auto-commits/auto-pushes on every rebar write), but prioritize: this is the current\ncritical-path blocker for landing anything through Gerrit.\n\nSecond, related gate to watch (separate limit, not yet breached):\n  .github/workflows/verify-identity.yml:34  REBAR_CHECKOUT_PACK_LIMIT_KIB: 102400 (checkout pack)."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785874134248243001,"uuid":"32584da3-a570-4eb4-990d-94e34d6e417d"}